IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `lact-dates`
IMPORT `lact-claims`

-- Limitation Act 1985 (ACT), Parts 2 and 3 -- worked cases for every exported question of lact-claims.l4.
-- Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited text (and the readings in NOTES.md), not copied from the
-- encoding's output. Edges: the last day and the day after, 29 February, the 56-day window of s 21B, the 28-day
-- disability, 6 months to a shorter month, each condition failing in turn.
--
-- (c) Australian Capital Territory. Used under CC BY 4.0 (SOURCE-LICENSE.md). Unofficial text.
-- BASELINE ENCODING. Not for public use as advice. See NOTES.md.

§ `Cases`

GIVEN d IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
`on` d m y MEANS `the calendar date` d m y

`an adult's birthday` MEANS `on` 1 1 1980
`unused` MEANS `on` 1 1 2000

`PI` MEANS `damages for my personal injury`
`motor` MEANS `common law damages for my personal injury in a motor accident claim under the Motor Accident Injuries Act 2019, chapter 5`
`abuse` MEANS `damages for death or personal injury arising substantially from child abuse the injured person was subjected to as a child`
`child health` MEANS `damages for personal injury I suffered as a child, relating to a health service`
`death` MEANS `damages for a death caused by a wrongful act, neglect or default, under the Civil Law (Wrongs) Act 2002, part 3.1`

§§ `Dictionary -- under a disability`

#ASSERT `dictionary -- am I under a disability` 17 FALSE 0 `some other reason, or I can manage them`
#ASSERT `dictionary -- am I under a disability` 18 TRUE 28 `intellectual retardation or disability, mental illness or disorder, brain damage, senility or physical disability`
#ASSERT (NOT (`dictionary -- am I under a disability` 18 TRUE 27 `intellectual retardation or disability, mental illness or disorder, brain damage, senility or physical disability`))
#ASSERT (NOT (`dictionary -- am I under a disability` 30 TRUE 60 `some other reason, or I can manage them`))
#ASSERT (NOT (`dictionary -- am I under a disability` 18 FALSE 60 `intellectual retardation or disability, mental illness or disorder, brain damage, senility or physical disability`))
#ASSERT `dictionary -- am I under a disability` 40 TRUE 28 `war or warlike operations`
#ASSERT `dictionary -- am I under a disability` 40 TRUE 90 `circumstances arising out of war or warlike operations`

§§ `Am I in time, given the last day (the regulative rule)`

-- Time began 10 March 2020; last day 10 March 2023.
#ASSERT `am I in time, given the last day` TRUE (`on` 10 3 2023) `unused` (`on` 10 3 2020) (`on` 10 3 2023) EQUALS `in time: you brought the action on or before the last day`
#ASSERT `am I in time, given the last day` TRUE (`on` 11 3 2023) `unused` (`on` 10 3 2020) (`on` 10 3 2023) EQUALS `out of time: the last day has passed, and the action is not maintainable unless the time is postponed or extended (Part 3)`
#ASSERT `am I in time, given the last day` TRUE (`on` 9 3 2023) `unused` (`on` 10 3 2020) (`on` 10 3 2023) EQUALS `in time: you brought the action on or before the last day`
#ASSERT `am I in time, given the last day` FALSE `unused` (`on` 10 3 2023) (`on` 10 3 2020) (`on` 10 3 2023) EQUALS `still in time: you have not brought the action, and the last day has not passed`
#ASSERT `am I in time, given the last day` FALSE `unused` (`on` 11 3 2023) (`on` 10 3 2020) (`on` 10 3 2023) EQUALS `out of time: the last day has passed, and the action is not maintainable unless the time is postponed or extended (Part 3)`
-- Brought before time began to run: counted as day 0 (fork F9).
#ASSERT `am I in time, given the last day` TRUE (`on` 1 1 2020) `unused` (`on` 10 3 2020) (`on` 10 3 2023) EQUALS `in time: you brought the action on or before the last day`
-- Brought on the day time began.
#ASSERT `am I in time, given the last day` TRUE (`on` 10 3 2020) `unused` (`on` 10 3 2020) (`on` 10 3 2023) EQUALS `in time: you brought the action on or before the last day`

§§ `Which time limit applies (ss 4, 10, 16, 16A, 16AA, 16B, 21C, 30B)`

#ASSERT `which time limit applies to my injury claim` `PI` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `s 16B: 3 years after the day the injury happened or, for a disease or disorder, after the day you first know both that you have it and that it is related to someone else's act or omission`
#ASSERT `which time limit applies to my injury claim` `PI` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `s 16A: 3 years after the day the injury happened`
#ASSERT `which time limit applies to my injury claim` `PI` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `s 16B: 3 years after the day the injury happened or, for a disease or disorder, after the day you first know both that you have it and that it is related to someone else's act or omission`
#ASSERT `which time limit applies to my injury claim` `PI` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `s 16B: 3 years after the day the injury happened or, for a disease or disorder, after the day you first know both that you have it and that it is related to someone else's act or omission`
#ASSERT `which time limit applies to my injury claim` `motor` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `s 16AA: 5 years after the day the injury happened`
#ASSERT `which time limit applies to my injury claim` `motor` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `s 16A and s 16AA both apply, so the earlier ends the time (s 10): 3 years after the day the injury happened`
#ASSERT `which time limit applies to my injury claim` `abuse` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `none: the action may be brought at any time (s 21C)`
#ASSERT `which time limit applies to my injury claim` `abuse` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `none: the action may be brought at any time (s 21C)`
#ASSERT `which time limit applies to my injury claim` `child health` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `s 30B: 6 years after the accident or, for a disease or disorder, the earlier of 6 years after the day of first knowledge and 12 years after the accident`
#ASSERT `which time limit applies to my injury claim` `death` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `s 16: 6 years after the wrongful act, neglect or default, or 3 years after the death, whichever ends later`
#ASSERT `which time limit applies to my injury claim` `PI` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `none from this Act: another ACT law fixes the time limit, and this Act does not apply (s 4)`

§§ `The last day for my injury or death claim`

-- s 16B, not a disease: 3 years after the day of injury.
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `PI` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`on` 10 3 2020) `unused` `unused` `unused` `an adult's birthday` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 10 3 2023)
-- s 16B, a disease: 3 years after the later of the two days of knowledge (1 February 2020).
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `PI` FALSE FALSE TRUE (`on` 1 1 2015) (`on` 5 5 2019) (`on` 1 2 2020) `unused` `an adult's birthday` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 2 2023)
-- s 16B from 29 February 2024: 28 February 2027 (fork F1).
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `PI` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`on` 29 2 2024) `unused` `unused` `unused` `an adult's birthday` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 28 2 2027)
-- s 16A: 3 years. s 16AA: 5 years. Both: s 10, the earlier.
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `PI` TRUE TRUE FALSE (`on` 10 3 2020) `unused` `unused` `unused` `an adult's birthday` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 10 3 2023)
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `motor` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`on` 10 3 2020) `unused` `unused` `unused` `an adult's birthday` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 10 3 2025)
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `motor` TRUE TRUE FALSE (`on` 10 3 2020) `unused` `unused` `unused` `an adult's birthday` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 10 3 2023)
-- s 16: the later of 6 years after the act (1 June 2024) and 3 years after the death (1 June 2026).
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `death` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`on` 1 6 2018) `unused` `unused` (`on` 1 6 2023) `an adult's birthday` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 6 2026)
-- s 16: death soon after the act: 6 years after the act is later.
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `death` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`on` 1 6 2018) `unused` `unused` (`on` 1 7 2018) `an adult's birthday` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 6 2024)
-- s 16 with a young claimant: no minority postponement is taken (fork F6).
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `death` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`on` 1 6 2018) `unused` `unused` (`on` 1 7 2018) (`on` 1 1 2010) FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 6 2024)
-- s 30B, not a disease: 6 years after the accident; s 30 does not apply, so no minority postponement (s 30 (3) (b)).
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `child health` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`on` 15 8 2015) `unused` `unused` `unused` (`on` 1 1 2010) FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 15 8 2021)
-- s 30B (3), a disease: the earlier of 6 years from the earlier day of knowledge (1 March 2026) and 12 years from the accident (15 August 2022).
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `child health` FALSE FALSE TRUE (`on` 15 8 2010) (`on` 1 3 2020) (`on` 1 1 2021) `unused` (`on` 1 1 2008) FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 15 8 2022)
-- s 30B (3), a disease known early: 6 years from 1 March 2017 (1 March 2023) ends before 12 years (15 August 2027).
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `child health` FALSE FALSE TRUE (`on` 15 8 2015) (`on` 1 6 2018) (`on` 1 3 2017) `unused` (`on` 1 1 2008) FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 3 2023)
-- s 21C: no last day.
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `abuse` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`on` 1 1 1990) `unused` `unused` `unused` (`on` 1 1 1980) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 4: another ACT law fixes the time limit (or would, a government being a party): no last day from this Act; s 21C
-- still comes first (fork F13).
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `PI` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`on` 10 3 2020) `unused` `unused` `unused` `an adult's birthday` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `abuse` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`on` 1 1 1990) `unused` `unused` `unused` (`on` 1 1 1980) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 16B for a child injured at 9 (born 1 July 2005, injured 10 March 2015): the 3 years (to 10 March 2018) are suspended
-- from 10 March 2015 to the 18th birthday, 1 July 2023, giving 1 July 2026; 3 years after the 18th birthday is also
-- 1 July 2026.
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `PI` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`on` 10 3 2015) `unused` `unused` `unused` (`on` 1 7 2005) FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 7 2026)
-- s 16A for a worker injured at 17 (born 1 June 2002, injured 1 January 2020): the period runs from 2 January 2020
-- (fork F1) and is suspended until the 18th birthday (1 June 2020), 151 days (2 January to 31 May 2020); the last day
-- 1 January 2023 moves to 1 June 2023, which is also 3 years after the birthday.
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `PI` TRUE TRUE FALSE (`on` 1 1 2020) `unused` `unused` `unused` (`on` 1 6 2002) FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 6 2023)
-- Injured on the 18th birthday: no longer under 18, so no postponement.
#ASSERT `the last day for my injury claim` `PI` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`on` 1 6 2020) `unused` `unused` `unused` (`on` 1 6 2002) FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 6 2023)

