§§ `s 11, s 21, defamation`

#ASSERT `s 11 -- the last day under the general rule` (`on` 1 1 2020) EQUALS `on` 1 1 2026
#ASSERT `s 11 -- the last day under the general rule` (`on` 29 2 2020) EQUALS `on` 28 2 2026
-- s 21: the earlier of 2 years after the judgment (1 July 2026) and 4 years after the principal period ended (1 January 2027).
#ASSERT `s 21 -- the last day for my contribution claim` (`on` 1 7 2024) (`on` 1 1 2023) EQUALS `on` 1 7 2026
-- s 21: the principal period ended long ago: 4 years after 1 January 2020.
#ASSERT `s 21 -- the last day for my contribution claim` (`on` 1 7 2024) (`on` 1 1 2020) EQUALS `on` 1 1 2024

-- s 21BA: the first publication is 1 March 2024; the later one 1 March 2025.
#ASSERT `s 21BA -- the day time runs from for the later publication` TRUE `the first publisher` TRUE FALSE (`on` 1 3 2024) (`on` 1 3 2025) EQUALS `on` 1 3 2024
#ASSERT `s 21BA -- the day time runs from for the later publication` TRUE `an employee of the first publisher` TRUE FALSE (`on` 1 3 2024) (`on` 1 3 2025) EQUALS `on` 1 3 2024
#ASSERT `s 21BA -- the day time runs from for the later publication` TRUE `an associated entity of the first publisher (Corporations Act s 50AAA), or its employee or contractor` TRUE FALSE (`on` 1 3 2024) (`on` 1 3 2025) EQUALS `on` 1 3 2024
#ASSERT `s 21BA -- the day time runs from for the later publication` TRUE `someone else` TRUE FALSE (`on` 1 3 2024) (`on` 1 3 2025) EQUALS `on` 1 3 2025
#ASSERT `s 21BA -- the day time runs from for the later publication` TRUE `the first publisher` TRUE TRUE (`on` 1 3 2024) (`on` 1 3 2025) EQUALS `on` 1 3 2025
#ASSERT `s 21BA -- the day time runs from for the later publication` TRUE `the first publisher` FALSE FALSE (`on` 1 3 2024) (`on` 1 3 2025) EQUALS `on` 1 3 2025
#ASSERT `s 21BA -- the day time runs from for the later publication` FALSE `the first publisher` TRUE FALSE (`on` 1 3 2024) (`on` 1 3 2025) EQUALS `on` 1 3 2025

-- s 21B: published 1 March 2024; the 1-year last day is 1 March 2025.
#ASSERT `s 21B -- the last day for my defamation claim` (`on` 1 3 2024) FALSE `unused` EQUALS `on` 1 3 2025
-- Concerns notice 7 days before (22 February 2025): 56 - 7 = 49 more days, to 19 April 2025.
#ASSERT `s 21B -- the last day for my defamation claim` (`on` 1 3 2024) TRUE (`on` 22 2 2025) EQUALS `on` 19 4 2025
-- Notice on the last day: 56 more days, to 26 April 2025.
#ASSERT `s 21B -- the last day for my defamation claim` (`on` 1 3 2024) TRUE (`on` 1 3 2025) EQUALS `on` 26 4 2025
-- Notice 55 days before (5 January 2025): 1 more day.
#ASSERT `s 21B -- the last day for my defamation claim` (`on` 1 3 2024) TRUE (`on` 5 1 2025) EQUALS `on` 2 3 2025
-- Notice 56 days before (4 January 2025): no extension.
#ASSERT `s 21B -- the last day for my defamation claim` (`on` 1 3 2024) TRUE (`on` 4 1 2025) EQUALS `on` 1 3 2025
-- Notice after the period expired, or months before: no extension.
#ASSERT `s 21B -- the last day for my defamation claim` (`on` 1 3 2024) TRUE (`on` 2 3 2025) EQUALS `on` 1 3 2025
#ASSERT `s 21B -- the last day for my defamation claim` (`on` 1 3 2024) TRUE (`on` 1 6 2024) EQUALS `on` 1 3 2025
#ASSERT `s 21BB -- the latest day the court can extend my defamation time to` (`on` 1 3 2024) EQUALS `on` 1 3 2027

§§ `s 30 Disability`

-- Time began 1 January 2020; last day 1 January 2023 unless said otherwise.
-- s 30B claim: s 30 does not apply.
#ASSERT `s 30 -- my last day after a disability` (`on` 1 1 2020) (`on` 1 1 2023) (`on` 1 1 2021) (`on` 1 7 2021) FALSE FALSE `unused` TRUE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 1 2023)
-- Disability begins the day after the last day: no effect.
#ASSERT `s 30 -- my last day after a disability` (`on` 1 1 2020) (`on` 1 1 2023) (`on` 2 1 2023) (`on` 1 2 2023) FALSE FALSE `unused` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 1 2023)
-- Disability begins on the last day (1 January 2023), ends 1 February 2023: 31 days suspended (1 February 2023); 3 years after the end is later (1 February 2026).
#ASSERT `s 30 -- my last day after a disability` (`on` 1 1 2020) (`on` 1 1 2023) (`on` 1 1 2023) (`on` 1 2 2023) FALSE FALSE `unused` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 2 2026)
-- Disability over before time began: no effect.
#ASSERT `s 30 -- my last day after a disability` (`on` 1 1 2020) (`on` 1 1 2023) (`on` 1 1 2018) (`on` 1 6 2019) FALSE FALSE `unused` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 1 2023)
-- Still under it: suspended, no last day yet.
#ASSERT `s 30 -- my last day after a disability` (`on` 1 1 2020) (`on` 1 1 2023) (`on` 1 1 2021) `unused` TRUE FALSE `unused` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 1 January to 1 July 2021 (181 days): suspended to 1 July 2023; extended to 3 years after it ended, 1 July 2024 (s 30 (1) (f)).
#ASSERT `s 30 -- my last day after a disability` (`on` 1 1 2020) (`on` 1 1 2023) (`on` 1 1 2021) (`on` 1 7 2021) FALSE FALSE `unused` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 7 2024)
-- A 6-year period (to 1 January 2026), 29 days of disability in February 2020: suspended to 30 January 2026, later than 1 March 2023.
#ASSERT `s 30 -- my last day after a disability` (`on` 1 1 2020) (`on` 1 1 2026) (`on` 1 2 2020) (`on` 1 3 2020) FALSE FALSE `unused` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 30 1 2026)
-- Died while still under it (1 August 2022): 61 days suspended (3 March 2023); 3 years after the death is later (1 August 2025).
#ASSERT `s 30 -- my last day after a disability` (`on` 1 1 2020) (`on` 1 1 2023) (`on` 1 6 2022) `unused` TRUE TRUE (`on` 1 8 2022) FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 8 2025)
-- Disability ended 1 July 2022, death 1 September 2022: the earlier date (1 July 2022) counts; 1 July 2025.
#ASSERT `s 30 -- my last day after a disability` (`on` 1 1 2020) (`on` 1 1 2023) (`on` 1 6 2022) (`on` 1 7 2022) FALSE TRUE (`on` 1 9 2022) FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 7 2025)
-- Under it before time began, until 1 March 2020: the period runs from 2 January 2020 (fork F1), so 59 days are
-- suspended (2 January to 29 February 2020), giving 1 March 2023; 3 years after 1 March 2020 is also 1 March 2023.
#ASSERT `s 30 -- my last day after a disability` (`on` 1 1 2020) (`on` 1 1 2023) (`on` 1 1 2019) (`on` 1 3 2020) FALSE FALSE `unused` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 3 2023)
-- Disability ending on the day time began: nothing suspended; 3 years after that day is the last day itself.
#ASSERT `s 30 -- my last day after a disability` (`on` 1 1 2020) (`on` 1 1 2023) (`on` 1 1 2019) (`on` 1 1 2020) FALSE FALSE `unused` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 1 2023)
-- Disability beginning on the day time began, ending 1 February 2020: 30 days (2 to 31 January 2020) suspended
-- (31 January 2023); 3 years after the end is later (1 February 2023).
#ASSERT `s 30 -- my last day after a disability` (`on` 1 1 2020) (`on` 1 1 2023) (`on` 1 1 2020) (`on` 1 2 2020) FALSE FALSE `unused` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`on` 1 2 2023)

§§ `s 30A Injuries to children`

#ASSERT `s 30A -- the last day to give notice of the intended claim` FALSE (`on` 10 3 2015) `unused` `unused` EQUALS `on` 10 3 2021
