#ASSERT `s 30A (7) -- can damages for services before the proceeding be awarded` FALSE (`on` 10 3 2015) `unused` `unused` TRUE (`on` 11 3 2021) TRUE FALSE `unused` (`on` 1 1 2022) FALSE EQUALS `they must not be awarded: medical, legal or gratuitous services provided before the day the proceeding began (s 30A (7)); you may still bring the proceeding`
